1  SUPPORT AND RESISTANCE HIGH BREAKOUT
Make lines for support and resistance
when the price breaks resistance and create one more green brick - BUY
when it again creates a red brick - SELL


2 TWO BACK PATTERN
when a stock is in upward trend - then it created a bit correction (two red bricks) and then creates 3 green brick = ENTER in the TRADE ==> BUY
when it again creates a red brick - SELL

3 ONE BACK PATTERN
when a stock is in upward trend - then it created a bit correction (one red bricks) and then creates 2 green brick = ENTER in the TRADE ==> BUY
when it again creates a red brick - SELL

4 DOUBLE BOTTOM PATTERN
When price hits a LOW - then slightly RISE and again hit the same BOTTOM and then it again goes HIGH. when it breaks the previous HIGH => ENTER in the trade.
when it again creates a red brick - SELL

5 TRIPLE BOTTOM PATTERN
SAME as double bottom - just it will have three lows
